==== cold_run_naso.blessing sig ('case', 'data') (4213 chars) asks-in-source ['counts', 'face_lifted', 'form', 'four_times', 'language', 'name', 'priests_blessed', 'quorum', 'three_commands', 'translated', 'who_blesses', 'who_is_blessed']
